Phase 13 interprocedural-defect corpus
=======================================

This directory holds Phase 13's own `.lang` fixtures for the agent-repair
loop over interprocedural defect classes (DX-07). It carries forward the
`heldout_`/`derivation_` prefix contract `testdata/phase6/README` established
for Phase 6's defect-injection corpus:

- `derivation_*.lang` -- the ONLY fixtures anyone may consult when hand-
  deriving a repair's kind->edit mapping, or when tuning a repair emission
  site against a real program. This plan's own end-to-end verification runs
  directly against `derivation_interprocedural_loan_defect.lang`.
- `heldout_*.lang` -- reserved for a future plan's CI-gate corpus, scored
  only by the repair driver, never consulted by hand when deriving a
  repair's edit.

No file in this directory may be named `heldout_match_defect.lang` -- that
exact name is `cmd/lang/main.go`'s `isPhase6Corpus` dispatch marker
(`os.Stat(filepath.Join(corpus, "heldout_match_defect.lang"))`), and creating
it here would cause `testdata/phase13` to be misrouted as a Phase 6 corpus by
any tool that walks `testdata/` looking for that marker.
